WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.040
...in a healthy way. Everything started with
robotics for me when my brother

00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:08.240
received a LEGO robot as a gift from America.
It seemed like an incredible tool

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:13.180
with incredible potential. But after a couple
of weeks, he put that LEGO robot in a drawer

00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:18.000
and forgot about it. We realised that having
just equipment is not enough.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.700
It's not enough to just have robots or VR glasses.
You need engaging, motivating, useful content.

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:28.540
You need a group, and you need goals:
reasons for why you're doing it.

00:00:28.540 --> 00:00:35.060
With virtual reality, we train the brain to prepare
children and young teenagers for the era of AI.
